# LM Builders — Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the real values.

## Required for email delivery (Resend)
# Get your API key from https://resend.com/api-keys
RESEND_API_KEY=

# The email address to receive quote enquiries
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=

# The verified sender email address in Resend (e.g. "LM Builders <hello@yourdomain.com>")
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=

## Sanity CMS (the content studio at /studio)

# Create a free project at https://www.sanity.io/manage
# The Project ID is under "Project settings" in your project.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_PROJECT_ID=

# The dataset the site reads from. "production" is the default.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_DATASET=production

# Only needed for PRIVATE datasets. Leave empty for a public dataset.
# Create one at https://www.sanity.io/manage → your project → API tokens
# (needs the "Viewer" permission).
SANITY_API_READ_TOKEN=

# Only used by `npm run seed` to create the initial content.
# Needs the "Editor" permission. NEVER commit a real value — keep it in
# your local .env.local only.
SANITY_API_WRITE_TOKEN=
